  "1239934": {
    "active": true,
    "notes": "undici WebSocket permessage-deflate unhandled error DoS (GHSA-3wwx-pv8p-q78v). Other undici copies in the tree are patched (6.29.0 / 7.30.0). Only path is the copy bundled inside npm (semantic-release > @semantic-release/npm > npm@11.20.0 > node-gyp > undici@6.28.0); npm ships it as a bundledDependency, so an override cannot reach it, and even the latest npm 11.x (11.21.0, verified 2026-10-05) still bundles undici@6.28.0. Dev-only, not shipped in the published package. No fix until npm releases an updated bundle. Review 2026-12-01.",
    "expiry": "2026-12-01"
  },
